# Published Production Source of Truth

Before WordPress cutover, `https://caminodeldharma.org` governs all visitor-facing copy, content,
structure, media relationships, styles, and behavior (OWN-007, ADR 0034, ADR 0040).

## Rules

1. Preserve the published visitor experience. The engine migration must be imperceptible except for
   explicitly approved features and content.
2. Use the latest repository `VERSION` as deterministic extraction input, then compare it against the
   published site. Record and resolve every repo/Hostinger delta before import (OWN-006).
3. Treat static HTML/JSON and referenced media as real production data, never fixtures.
4. The legacy source folder was permanently removed on 2026-08-29 (ADR 0040). Do not recreate it
   or use legacy documents to restore or overwrite production.
5. After cutover, WordPress owns editorial content; Git owns first-party theme and plugin code.

## Required evidence

- Content and visual comparison against the published site.
- Incoming-route, behavior, accessibility, and metadata parity.
- Explicit ledger entries for every approved static-to-WordPress difference.
